@startuml pitch_step_sequence
title chassis: weight on the axles and one pitch step
autonumber
participant "vehicle::step" as Step
participant "chassis::axle_loads" as Loads
participant "chassis::advance_pitch" as Pitch
participant "math::sin_cos" as Trig

== start of the step: who carries the weight ==
Step -> Loads : axle_loads(params, state)
Loads -> Trig : sin_cos(pitch)
Loads -> Loads : front tires: k δ + c δ' (δ from preload - L sin θ), ≥ 0
Loads -> Loads : wheelie bar tip: k δ + c δ' once it touches, ≥ 0
Loads -> Loads : rear = m g + m z''_cg - front - bar\n(z''_cg from last step's θ'' and θ')
Loads --> Step : rear / front / bar loads, front lifted
note over Step
  rear load sets traction; front and bar
  loads set their rolling drag (chain solve)
end note

== end of the step, after the chain solve and advance() ==
Step -> Step : axle torque = I_wheels α_axle + r F_tire + rear rolling\n(at a standstill the tires hold just the drawbar pull)
Step -> Pitch : advance_pitch(state, params, axle torque, drawbar, dt)
Pitch -> Trig : sin_cos(pitch)
Pitch -> Pitch : moment = axle torque + F_drawbar z_hitch\n  - m g x_cg + m a z_cg - ground drag · r
Pitch -> Pitch : contacts: force, moment and its\nderivatives K (pitch) and C (rate)
Pitch -> Pitch : implicit midpoint: solve for θ'\n(I/dt - K dt/4 - C/2) θ' = ...
Pitch -> Pitch : θ += dt (θ' + θ'_old) / 2, keep θ''
Pitch --> Step
@enduml
